@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@signingToken = replace-privately-from-authorized-fixture-invitation
@invitedEmail = signer@example.invalid

### Request a code for the exact authorized fixture signer
# Keep real tokens, cookies, codes and agreement responses outside this repository.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/partners/contracts/native
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"operation":"request_code","token":"{{signingToken}}","email":"{{invitedEmail}}"}

### Consume the fixture invitation and one-time email code
# Successful verification sets a contract-scoped HttpOnly signing cookie.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/partners/contracts/native
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"operation":"verify","token":"{{signingToken}}","email":"{{invitedEmail}}","code":"<private-one-time-code>"}

### Review the complete immutable agreement using the verified fixture cookie
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/partners/contracts/native
Cookie: useclevr-native-signing=<private-fixture-signing-cookie>

### Download the exact source PDF
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/partners/contracts/native?document=source
Cookie: useclevr-native-signing=<private-fixture-signing-cookie>

### Affirmatively sign only after authorized review and consent
# This records real signing intent. Use only disposable synthetic legal fixtures.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/partners/contracts/native
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
Cookie: useclevr-native-signing=<private-fixture-signing-cookie>
Content-Type: application/json

{"operation":"sign","signing":{"legalName":"<approved-fixture-signer-name>","documentChecksum":"<reviewed-source-sha256>","consentVersion":"native-electronic-signatures-2026-11-v1","consent":true,"reviewed":true,"action":"sign_agreement"}}

### Anonymous document access must fail
# Expected: 401 when management is enabled; 404 contract_management_disabled when off.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/partners/contracts/native?document=source
